{#
  Signed-in app shell, opening half (2.6, theme partial `app_shell_open`): root, header (burger, brand, header actions),
  aside (navigation) and the opening of the main region. A base layout includes the two halves around its own blocks,
  so {% block body %} is never captured (Twig allows one definition per block):

      {{ include(nowo_ui_partial('app_shell_open'), {brand_html: brand_html, header_end: header_end, aside_html: aside_html, aside_label: 'Admin'}) }}
          <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">{% block body %}{% endblock %}</main>
      {{ include(nowo_ui_partial('app_shell_close'), {footer_html: footer_html}) }}

  `app_shell` (shell/_shell.html.twig) composes both halves with blocks instead.

  Options marked "trusted HTML" are printed raw (|raw): pass only markup the host builds itself, never user, tenant or
  other stored input (a tenant logo goes to brand_icon_src, rendered as <img> where SVG scripts do not run; a tenant
  name goes to brand_name or brand, which are escaped).

  Options:
    - brand_html (trusted HTML) / brand (text): header brand (slot app_brand for the text)
    - header_end (HTML): header actions — global search, theme toggle, locale switcher, user menu…
    - show_user_menu + name, email, initials, avatar_src, user_links, logout_href, logout_path, logout_csrf: the UiKit
      user menu at the end of the header (default: when name or initials are given); 2.26: avatar_src goes through the
      avatar URL policy (https:// or a same-origin /path; anything else shows the initials)
    - aside_html (trusted HTML): the whole aside content, or aside_items ({label, href, current, children…}) + aside_label
    - aside_id (default nowo-ui-aside), aside_label (aria-label; default nav.aside)
    - collapsed / rail: the server-rendered desktop aside state; when not passed they come from the cookie
      nowo_ui_kit.shell.sidebar_cookie (= sidebar_hidden_value → collapsed, = sidebar_rail_value → rail)
    - rail_mode: true = three-mode aside (expanded / icons-only rail / hidden): burger rail labels, and with kit styles
      data-nowo-ui-sidebar-rail + storage / cookie attributes for nowo-ui-shell.js
    - content_width: full → is-full-width, anything else → is-content-width
    - attr / shell_attr: extra root attributes (no on*), after the `app_shell` slot attributes
    - kit_styles: override nowo_ui_kit.shell.kit_styles (true adds nowo-ui-shell / -header / -aside / -main classes)
    - burger_attr, burger_label_attr_names, burger_icon (svg | morph | none), burger_static_icons, burger_label,
      burger_label_expand / burger_label_rail / burger_label_hide: forwarded to the `app_shell_burger` partial
    - header_context (2.27, HTML): the compact header slot between the start and the end of the header (theme slot
      app_header_context, + nowo-ui-header__context with kit styles, hook data-nowo-ui-header-context) — typically
      the `header_context` partial (page actions, home link, compact breadcrumb). Only rendered when not blank; then
      the root gets has-header-context. Empty or whitespace = the 2.26 markup, byte for byte
    - sidebar_layout (2.32): below-header (default: nowo_ui_kit.shell.sidebar_layout, overridden per request by the
      request attribute _nowo_ui_sidebar_layout; below-header = the 2.31 markup, byte for byte) | full-height: the root
      gets is-sidebar-full-height + data-nowo-ui-sidebar-layout="full-height" and the aside an aside head (slot
      app_aside_head, + nowo-ui-aside-head with kit styles, hook data-nowo-ui-aside-head) with a second burger (same
      partial and options) and the aside brand (slot app_aside_brand, hook data-nowo-ui-aside-brand). The header keeps
      its burger and brand for phones and for a hidden aside; the kit CSS hides them on desktop while the aside shows
    - aside brand (2.32, full-height only), first match: aside_brand_html (trusted HTML; mark the name with the class
      nowo-ui-aside-brand__name so the icons-only rail hides it), else brand_icon_html (trusted HTML) / brand_icon_src
      (image URL: relative, http or https, else dropped; rendered as <img alt="">) + brand_name (text, escaped) +
      brand_href (relative, http, https or mailto, else no link) (defaults: nowo_ui_kit.shell.brand.icon_src / name /
      href), else brand_html, else brand (its initial as the icon). The parts (slots app_aside_brand_icon / app_aside_brand_name) also fill the
      header brand when neither brand_html nor brand is given
    - hover_expand (2.32; default nowo_ui_kit.shell.hover_expand): with kit styles and rail_mode, the icons-only rail
      widens over the page on hover / focus (data-nowo-ui-sidebar-hover-expand; nowo-ui-shell.js sets is-aside-peek)
    - bundle: per-bundle theme exceptions
  Root state classes: is-sidebar-collapsed, is-sidebar-rail, is-full-width / is-content-width (+ is-aside-collapsed /
  is-aside-rail with kit styles, the classes nowo-ui-shell.js toggles). Hooks: data-nowo-ui-shell, data-nowo-ui-aside,
  data-nowo-ui-burger, data-nowo-ui-aside-backdrop.
  Slots: app_shell, app_header, app_header_start, app_header_context (2.27), app_header_end, app_brand, app_aside, app_aside_inner,
  app_aside_label, app_aside_nav, app_main (+ app_burger… in the burger, app_backdrop in the closing half); 2.32:
  app_aside_head, app_aside_brand, app_aside_brand_icon, app_aside_brand_name.
#}
{% set bundle = bundle|default(null) %}
{% set _cfg = nowo_ui_kit_shell|default({}) %}
{% set _kit = kit_styles ?? (_cfg.kit_styles ?? true) %}
{% set _request = app is defined and app ? app.request : null %}
{% set _cookie = _cfg.sidebar_cookie|default(null) and _request ? _request.cookies.get(_cfg.sidebar_cookie) : null %}
{% set aside_id = aside_id|default('nowo-ui-aside') %}
{% set _collapsed = collapsed ?? (_cookie is not null and _cookie == (_cfg.sidebar_hidden_value ?? 'collapsed')) %}
{% set _rail = not _collapsed and (rail ?? (_cookie is not null and _cookie == (_cfg.sidebar_rail_value ?? 'rail'))) %}
{% set _rail_mode = rail_mode|default(false) %}
{% set _full = content_width|default('content') == 'full' %}
{% set _state = (_full ? 'is-full-width' : 'is-content-width')
    ~ (_collapsed ? ' is-sidebar-collapsed' ~ (_kit ? ' is-aside-collapsed') : '')
    ~ (_rail ? ' is-sidebar-rail' ~ (_kit ? ' is-aside-rail') : '') %}
{% set _full_height = nowo_ui_sidebar_layout(sidebar_layout ?? null) == 'full-height' %}
{% if _full_height %}
    {% set _state = _state ~ ' is-sidebar-full-height' %}
{% endif %}
{% set _root_attr = {}|merge(attr|default({}))|merge(shell_attr|default({})) %}
{% if _kit and _rail_mode %}
    {% set _root_attr = {
        'data-nowo-ui-sidebar-rail': true,
        'data-nowo-ui-sidebar-storage': _cfg.sidebar_storage|default(null),
        'data-nowo-ui-sidebar-cookie': _cfg.sidebar_cookie|default(null),
        'data-nowo-ui-sidebar-hidden-value': _cfg.sidebar_cookie|default(null) ? (_cfg.sidebar_hidden_value ?? 'collapsed') : null,
        'data-nowo-ui-sidebar-mode': _collapsed ? 'hidden' : (_rail ? 'rail' : 'expanded'),
        'data-nowo-ui-sidebar-hover-expand': (hover_expand ?? (_cfg.hover_expand ?? false)) ? true : null,
    }|merge(_root_attr) %}
{% endif %}
{% if _full_height %}
    {% set _root_attr = {'data-nowo-ui-sidebar-layout': 'full-height'}|merge(_root_attr) %}
{% endif %}
{% set _burger = {
    controls: aside_id,
    expanded: not _collapsed,
    rail: _rail,
    rail_mode: _rail_mode,
    kit_styles: _kit,
    label: burger_label|default(null),
    label_expand: burger_label_expand|default(null),
    label_rail: burger_label_rail|default(null),
    label_hide: burger_label_hide|default(null),
    label_attr_names: burger_label_attr_names|default({}),
    attr: burger_attr|default({}),
    icon: burger_icon|default('svg'),
    static_icons: burger_static_icons|default(['open', 'close']),
    bundle: bundle,
} %}
{% set _brand_cfg = _cfg.brand|default({}) %}
{% set _brand_name = brand_name ?? (_brand_cfg.name ?? null) %}
{% set _brand_href = nowo_ui_safe_href(brand_href ?? (_brand_cfg.href ?? null)) %}
{% set _brand_icon_src = nowo_ui_safe_image_src(brand_icon_src ?? (_brand_cfg.icon_src ?? null)) %}
{% set _brand_icon = brand_icon_html ?? null %}
{% set _has_brand_parts = _brand_icon or _brand_icon_src or (_brand_name is not null and _brand_name is not same as('')) %}
{% set aside_label = aside_label|default('nav.aside'|trans({}, 'NowoUiKitBundle')) %}
{% set _header_context = header_context is defined and header_context ? header_context|trim : '' %}
<div class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_shell', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-shell' }} {{ _state }}{{ _header_context is not same as('') ? ' has-header-context' }}" data-nowo-ui-shell{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_shell', bundle, _root_attr) }}>
    <header class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_header', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-header' }}"{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_header', bundle) }}>
        <div class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_header_start', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-header__start' }}"{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_header_start', bundle) }}>
            {{ include(nowo_ui_partial('app_shell_burger', bundle), _burger, false) }}
            {% if brand_html is defined and brand_html %}
                {{ brand_html|raw }}
            {% elseif brand is defined and brand %}
                <strong class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_brand', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-header__brand' }}"{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_brand', bundle) }}>{{ brand }}</strong>
            {% elseif _has_brand_parts %}
                {{ include('@NowoUiKitBundle/shell/_brand_parts.html.twig', {slot: 'app_brand', kit_class: 'nowo-ui-header__brand nowo-ui-aside-brand', name: _brand_name, href: _brand_href, icon_html: _brand_icon, icon_src: _brand_icon_src, kit: _kit, bundle: bundle}, false) }}
            {% endif %}
        </div>
{% if _header_context is not same as('') %}
        <div class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_header_context', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-header__context' }}" data-nowo-ui-header-context{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_header_context', bundle) }}>
            {{ _header_context|raw }}
        </div>
{% endif %}
        <div class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_header_end', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-header__end' }}"{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_header_end', bundle) }}>
            {% if header_end is defined and header_end %}
                {{ header_end|raw }}
            {% endif %}
            {% if show_user_menu|default(name is defined or initials is defined) %}
                {{ include('@NowoUiKitBundle/partials/_user_menu.html.twig', {
                    name: name|default(null),
                    email: email|default(null),
                    initials: initials|default(null),
                    avatar_src: avatar_src|default(null),
                    links: user_links|default([]),
                    logout_href: logout_href|default(null),
                    logout_path: logout_path|default(null),
                    logout_csrf: logout_csrf|default(null),
                    framework: framework|default(null),
                }, false) }}
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </header>

    <aside id="{{ aside_id }}" class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_aside', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-aside' }}" data-nowo-ui-aside aria-label="{{ aside_label }}"{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_aside', bundle) }}>
{% if _full_height %}
        <div class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_aside_head', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-aside-head' }}" data-nowo-ui-aside-head{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_aside_head', bundle) }}>
            {{ include(nowo_ui_partial('app_shell_burger', bundle), _burger, false) }}
            {% if aside_brand_html is defined and aside_brand_html %}
                <div class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_aside_brand', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-aside-brand' }}" data-nowo-ui-aside-brand{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_aside_brand', bundle) }}>{{ aside_brand_html|raw }}</div>
            {% elseif _has_brand_parts %}
                {{ include('@NowoUiKitBundle/shell/_brand_parts.html.twig', {slot: 'app_aside_brand', kit_class: 'nowo-ui-aside-brand', hook: true, name: _brand_name, href: _brand_href, icon_html: _brand_icon, icon_src: _brand_icon_src, kit: _kit, bundle: bundle}, false) }}
            {% elseif brand_html is defined and brand_html %}
                <div class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_aside_brand', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-aside-brand' }}" data-nowo-ui-aside-brand{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_aside_brand', bundle) }}>{{ brand_html|raw }}</div>
            {% elseif brand is defined and brand %}
                {{ include('@NowoUiKitBundle/shell/_brand_parts.html.twig', {slot: 'app_aside_brand', kit_class: 'nowo-ui-aside-brand', hook: true, name: brand, href: null, icon_html: null, icon_src: null, kit: _kit, bundle: bundle}, false) }}
            {% endif %}
        </div>
{% endif %}
        {% if aside_html is defined and aside_html %}
            {{ aside_html|raw }}
        {% else %}
            <div class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_aside_inner', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-aside__inner' }}"{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_aside_inner', bundle) }}>
                {% if aside_label %}
                    <p class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_aside_label', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-aside__label' }}"{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_aside_label', bundle) }}>{{ aside_label }}</p>
                {% endif %}
                <nav class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_aside_nav', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-aside__nav' }}"{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_aside_nav', bundle) }}>
                    {{ include('@NowoUiKitBundle/partials/_aside_nav_items.html.twig', {items: aside_items|default([]), prefix: aside_id}, false) }}
                </nav>
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    </aside>

    <div class="{{ nowo_ui_class('app_main', bundle) }}{{ _kit ? ' nowo-ui-main' }}"{{ nowo_ui_attrs('app_main', bundle) }}>
